sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor T as Tester
  participant UI as Lab UI
  participant API as Lab API
  participant REG as ScenarioRegistry
  participant RUN as ScenarioRunner
  participant GW as SentinelGateway
  participant SW as SentinelWeb

  T->>UI: click Run on "Password guessing"
  UI->>API: POST /api/run/brute-force
  API->>REG: get("brute-force")
  REG-->>API: Scenario (1 step, repeat 6)
  API->>RUN: run(scenario)
  RUN->>GW: latest_event_id()
  GW->>SW: GET /api/events?limit=1
  SW-->>GW: last id = 41
  loop for each expanded request ({n} = 1..6)
    RUN->>GW: send(POST, /demo/login, body password=guess{n})
    GW->>SW: POST /demo/login
    SW-->>GW: 401 (x5), then 429
  end
  RUN->>GW: events_after(41)
  GW->>SW: GET /api/events?limit=200
  SW-->>GW: new events (LOW x4, MEDIUM Repeated failed logins)
  RUN->>RUN: compare_with_expectation(MEDIUM, events)
  RUN-->>API: statuses, events, verdict matches = true
  API-->>UI: JSON result
  UI-->>T: result card: chips, verdict, "As expected"
